---
import AssetImage from '../../../components/AssetImage.astro';
import CaseStudyLayout from '../../../layouts/CaseStudyLayout.astro';
import { pageUrl } from '../../../lib/site';

const lang = 'en' as const;
const canonical = pageUrl('/en/realizacja-k2/');
---

<CaseStudyLayout
  lang={lang}
  title="K2 Fish Farm · Rebranding, website, photo & drone · SEZMOO case study"
  description="SEZMOO case study: logo refresh, brand guidelines, new website, photography, drone film and a presentation template for K2 Fish Farm, a rainbow trout producer in Poland."
  canonical={canonical}
>
<!-- ============ COVER ============ -->
<header class="cs-hero" data-screen-label="Case · Cover">
  <div class="cs-hero__media">
    <AssetImage src="/assets/portfolio/k2/k2-hodowla-pstraga-zdjecie-z-drona-baseny.webp" alt="K2 trout farm from above – fish ponds surrounded by forest, drone photo" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" widths={[720, 1080, 1440, 1920]} sizes="100vw" quality={72} />
  </div>
  <div class="cs-hero__hud">
    <span class="rec">REBRANDING · WEB</span>
    <span>PHOTO · DRONE</span>
    <span>AQUACULTURE / PL</span>
  </div>
  <div class="cs-hero__inner shell">
    <a class="cs-hero__back" href="/en/portfolio-en/">← Portfolio / Work</a>
    <span class="eyebrow cs-hero__cat"><span class="tick"></span>SEZMOO × K2 Fish Farm · Brand refresh</span>
    <h1 class="cs-title">K2 Fish<br><span class="accent">Farm.</span></h1>
    <p class="cs-hero__sub">A refreshed logo, brand guidelines, a new website, photography, a drone film and a presentation template for <b>K2 Fish Farm</b>, one of the largest rainbow trout producers in Poland.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="cs-scroll" aria-hidden="true"><span>SCROLL</span><i></i></div>
</header>

<!-- ============ META ============ -->
<section class="cs-meta" aria-label="Project details">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="cs-meta__grid">
      <div class="cs-meta__cell"><div class="cs-meta__k">Client</div><div class="cs-meta__v">K2 Fish Farm<small>Jacek Juchniewicz</small></div></div>
      <div class="cs-meta__cell"><div class="cs-meta__k">Industry</div><div class="cs-meta__v">Aquaculture<small>Rainbow trout</small></div></div>
      <div class="cs-meta__cell"><div class="cs-meta__k">Format</div><div class="cs-meta__v">Rebranding<small>Brand refresh</small></div></div>
      <div class="cs-meta__cell"><div class="cs-meta__k">Scope</div><div class="cs-meta__v">Full-service<small>Logo · Web · Photo · Drone</small></div></div>
      <div class="cs-meta__cell"><div class="cs-meta__k">Online</div><div class="cs-meta__v"><a href="https://hodowlak2.pl/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color:inherit">hodowlak2.pl ↗</a><small>Live website</small></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ O PROJEKCIE ============ -->
<section class="cs-sec" data-screen-label="ABOUT">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="cs-intro__grid">
      <div class="reveal">
        <span class="cs-sec__no">ABOUT THE PROJECT</span>
        <h2 class="cs-sec__title">A market leader<br>that finally <span class="accent">looks like one.</span></h2>
      </div>
      <div class="cs-body reveal" data-d="1">
        <p>For years K2 has been among the top trout producers in Poland, with its own hatchery, transport fleet and a family tradition. Its market position didn’t need building. It needed showing.</p>
        <p>The old logo and website didn’t match the scale of the business. We refreshed the mark, documented it in brand guidelines, designed and built a new website, and shot photos and a drone film on location. Finally, a presentation template for sales meetings.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ ZNAK: PRZED / PO ============ -->
<section class="cs-sec" style="padding-top:0" aria-label="Logo before and after" data-screen-label="Logo">
  <div class="shell">
    <span class="cs-sec__no reveal">LOGO · BEFORE &amp; AFTER</span>
    <h2 class="cs-sec__title reveal">Same fish,<br>new character.</h2>
    <p class="cs-body reveal" data-d="1" style="max-width:58ch;margin-top:20px">We kept what customers recognise: the fish and the K2 name. Everything else changed: a single line instead of a flat illustration, deep green instead of blue, and type that works on a truck as well as on a label.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="cs-row cs-row--split" style="margin-top:clamp(28px,4vh,48px)">
    <figure class="cs-shot cs-shot--ad reveal" style="aspect-ratio:16/10;background:#ffffff"><div class="frame-media cs-shot__media" style="background:#ffffff;display:grid;place-items:center"><AssetImage src="/assets/portfolio/k2/k2-stare-logo-hodowla-ryb.jpg" alt="Previous K2 Fish Farm logo – blue fish" loading="lazy" widths={[640, 960, 1280, 1600]} sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, min(1100px, 85vw)" quality={72} style="position:static;width:42%;height:auto;inset:auto;object-fit:contain" /></div><span class="cs-shot__tag" style="white-space:nowrap">Before</span></figure>
    <figure class="cs-shot cs-shot--ad reveal" data-d="1" style="aspect-ratio:16/10;background:#1e3b1f"><div class="frame-media cs-shot__media" style="background:#1e3b1f;display:grid;place-items:center"><AssetImage src="/assets/portfolio/k2/k2-logo-hodowla-ryb-biale.svg" alt="New K2 Fish Farm logo in white on green background" loading="lazy" widths={[640, 960, 1280, 1600]} sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, min(1100px, 85vw)" quality={72} style="position:static;width:46%;height:auto;inset:auto;object-fit:contain" /></div><span class="cs-shot__tag" style="white-space:nowrap">After · Refreshed logo</span></figure>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ BRAND GUIDELINES ============ -->
<section class="cs-sec" style="padding-top:0" data-screen-label="BRAND GUIDELINES">
  <div class="shell">
    <span class="cs-sec__no reveal">BRAND GUIDELINES</span>
    <h2 class="cs-sec__title reveal">Rules that look after<br>the brand for us.</h2>
    <p class="cs-body reveal" data-d="1" style="max-width:58ch;margin-top:20px">Primary and alternative versions, symbol, clear space, minimum sizes and palette: everything a printer, packaging supplier or agency needs to keep the logo consistent.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="shell" style="margin-top:clamp(36px,5vh,64px);padding-block:clamp(36px,6vw,90px);background:#14110d;display:grid;gap:clamp(36px,5vw,72px)">
    <div style="width:min(88%,1100px);margin-inline:auto"><div class="reveal" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;box-shadow:0 30px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.45),0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.3);transform:rotate(-1.2deg);position:relative"><div style="aspect-ratio:297/210;background:#eef0ec;position:relative;display:grid;place-items:center;overflow:hidden"><AssetImage src="/assets/portfolio/k2/k2-logo-hodowla-ryb-zielone.svg" alt="" loading="lazy" widths={[640, 960, 1280, 1600]} sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, min(1100px, 85vw)" quality={72} style="width:52%;height:auto" /><span style="position:absolute;left:5%;bottom:6%;font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(30,59,31,.6)">Brand guidelines</span></div><div style="aspect-ratio:297/210;background:#1e3b1f;position:relative;display:grid;place-items:center;overflow:hidden"><div style="text-align:center;font-family:Poppins,var(--font-display);color:#fff"><div style="font-size:clamp(14px,1.6vw,24px)">Primary</div><div style="font-size:clamp(7px,.6vw,9px);letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-top:6px;opacity:.75">Logo version</div></div><span style="position:absolute;left:5%;bottom:6%;font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(255,255,255,.6)">01</span></div><i style="position:absolute;top:0;bottom:0;left:50%;width:6%;transform:translateX(-50%);background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,rgba(0,0,0,.18) 45%,rgba(0,0,0,.28) 50%,rgba(0,0,0,.18) 55%,transparent);pointer-events:none"></i></div></div>
    <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,380px),1fr));gap:clamp(28px,4vw,56px);width:min(92%,1240px);margin-inline:auto">
      <div class="reveal" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;box-shadow:0 30px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.45),0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.3);transform:rotate(1deg);position:relative"><div style="aspect-ratio:297/210;background:#1e3b1f;position:relative;display:grid;place-items:center;overflow:hidden"><AssetImage src="/assets/portfolio/k2/k2-logo-hodowla-ryb-biale.svg" alt="" loading="lazy" widths={[640, 960, 1280, 1600]} sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, min(1100px, 85vw)" quality={72} style="width:52%;height:auto" /><span style="position:absolute;left:5%;bottom:6%;font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(255,255,255,.6)">Negative</span></div><div style="aspect-ratio:297/210;background:#eef0ec;position:relative;display:grid;place-items:center;overflow:hidden"><AssetImage src="/assets/portfolio/k2/k2-logo-hodowla-ryb-zielone.svg" alt="" loading="lazy" widths={[640, 960, 1280, 1600]} sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, min(1100px, 85vw)" quality={72} style="width:52%;height:auto" /><span style="position:absolute;left:5%;bottom:6%;font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(30,59,31,.6)">Positive</span></div><i style="position:absolute;top:0;bottom:0;left:50%;width:6%;transform:translateX(-50%);background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,rgba(0,0,0,.18) 45%,rgba(0,0,0,.28) 50%,rgba(0,0,0,.18) 55%,transparent);pointer-events:none"></i></div>
      <div class="reveal" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;box-shadow:0 30px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.45),0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.3);transform:rotate(-0.8deg);position:relative"><div style="aspect-ratio:297/210;background:#1e3b1f;position:relative;display:grid;place-items:center;overflow:hidden"><div style="text-align:center;font-family:Poppins,var(--font-display);color:#fff"><div style="font-size:clamp(14px,1.6vw,24px)">Alternative</div><div style="font-size:clamp(7px,.6vw,9px);letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-top:6px;opacity:.75">Logo version</div></div><span style="position:absolute;left:5%;bottom:6%;font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(255,255,255,.6)">02</span></div><div style="aspect-ratio:297/210;background:#eef0ec;position:relative;display:grid;place-items:center;overflow:hidden"><AssetImage src="/assets/portfolio/k2/k2-sygnet-zielony.svg" alt="" loading="lazy" widths={[640, 960, 1280, 1600]} sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, min(1100px, 85vw)" quality={72} style="width:40%;height:auto" /><span style="position:absolute;left:5%;bottom:6%;font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(30,59,31,.6)">Symbol</span></div><i style="position:absolute;top:0;bottom:0;left:50%;width:6%;transform:translateX(-50%);background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,rgba(0,0,0,.18) 45%,rgba(0,0,0,.28) 50%,rgba(0,0,0,.18) 55%,transparent);pointer-events:none"></i></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="reveal" style="margin-top:clamp(40px,6vh,72px);display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(200px,1fr));gap:clamp(10px,1.4vw,20px)">
      <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px"><div style="aspect-ratio:16/9;background:#1e3b1f;border:1px solid var(--line-soft)"></div><div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px;font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase"><span>K2 Green</span><span style="color:var(--fg-dim)">#1E3B1F</span></div></div><div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px"><div style="aspect-ratio:16/9;background:#eef0ec;border:1px solid var(--line-soft)"></div><div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px;font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase"><span>Mist</span><span style="color:var(--fg-dim)">#EEF0EC</span></div></div><div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px"><div style="aspect-ratio:16/9;background:#000000;border:1px solid var(--line-soft)"></div><div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px;font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase"><span>Black</span><span style="color:var(--fg-dim)">#000000</span></div></div><div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px"><div style="aspect-ratio:16/9;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid var(--line-soft)"></div><div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px;font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase"><span>White</span><span style="color:var(--fg-dim)">#FFFFFF</span></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ STRONA ============ -->
<section class="cs-sec" data-screen-label="WEBSITE">
  <div class="shell">
    <span class="cs-sec__no reveal">WEBSITE</span>
    <h2 class="cs-sec__title reveal">A modern website<br>for <span class="accent">40 years of tradition.</span></h2>
    <div class="cs-steps">
      <div class="cs-step reveal"><span class="cs-step__no">W1, 01</span><h3 class="cs-step__title">Structure &amp; UX</h3><p class="cs-step__desc">A simple path: the farm’s story, fish offered in three sizes, quality and certificates, contact for wholesale buyers.</p></div>
      <div class="cs-step reveal"><span class="cs-step__no">W1, 02</span><h3 class="cs-step__title">UI design</h3><p class="cs-step__desc">Large, natural drone shots and the deep green from the new guidelines. The site looks like the place it describes.</p></div>
      <div class="cs-step reveal"><span class="cs-step__no">W1, 03</span><h3 class="cs-step__title">Content &amp; blog</h3><p class="cs-step__desc">“About us”, “Fish” and “Trust &amp; quality” sections, EU funding information and a blog about fish farming.</p></div>
      <div class="cs-step reveal"><span class="cs-step__no">W1, 04</span><h3 class="cs-step__title">Build</h3><p class="cs-step__desc">A responsive WordPress site with an editing panel, contact form and SEO essentials.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="cs-gallery bleed" aria-label="K2 Fish Farm website">
  <div class="cs-row">
    <figure class="cs-shot cs-shot--ad reveal" style="aspect-ratio:1920/1200;background:#1e3b1f"><div class="frame-media cs-shot__media" style="background:#1e3b1f"><AssetImage src="/assets/portfolio/k2/k2-strona-www-strona-glowna-hero.webp" alt="hodowlak2.pl homepage – hero with drone photo of the fish farm" loading="lazy" widths={[640, 960, 1280, 1600]} sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, min(1100px, 85vw)" quality={72} /></div><span class="cs-shot__tag" style="white-space:nowrap">Website · Home</span></figure>
  </div>
  <div class="cs-row cs-row--split">
    <figure class="cs-shot cs-shot--ad reveal" style="aspect-ratio:4/3;background:#fff"><div class="frame-media cs-shot__media" style="background:#fff;overflow-y:auto;overscroll-behavior:contain" data-lenis-prevent><AssetImage src="/assets/portfolio/k2/k2-strona-www-strona-glowna-pelna.webp" alt="Full K2 Fish Farm homepage – all sections" loading="lazy" widths={[640, 960, 1280, 1600]} sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, min(1100px, 85vw)" quality={72} style="position:static;width:100%;height:auto;object-fit:initial" /></div><span class="cs-shot__tag" style="white-space:nowrap">Home · Scroll ↓</span></figure>
    <figure class="cs-shot cs-shot--ad reveal" data-d="1" style="aspect-ratio:4/3;background:#fff"><div class="frame-media cs-shot__media" style="background:#fff"><AssetImage src="/assets/portfolio/k2/k2-strona-www-oferta-ryby.webp" alt="Fish subpage – rainbow trout offer on the K2 website" loading="lazy" widths={[640, 960, 1280, 1600]} sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, min(1100px, 85vw)" quality={72} /></div><span class="cs-shot__tag" style="white-space:nowrap">Website · Offer</span></figure>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ FOTO ============ -->
<section class="cs-sec" data-screen-label="PHOTOS">
  <div class="shell">
    <span class="cs-sec__no reveal">PHOTOGRAPHY</span>
    <h2 class="cs-sec__title reveal">Shot on location,<br><span class="accent">at dawn.</span></h2>
    <p class="cs-body reveal" data-d="1" style="max-width:58ch;margin-top:20px">No stock photos, just the real farm. Several shoot days across the seasons: ponds, hatchery, people and surroundings. Used on the website, in the presentation and on social media.</p>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="cs-gallery bleed" aria-label="K2 Fish Farm photos" style="padding-top:0">
  <div class="cs-row">
    <figure class="cs-shot reveal" style="aspect-ratio:16/9"><div class="frame-media cs-shot__media"><AssetImage src="/assets/portfolio/k2/k2-hodowla-ryb-hodowca-na-lodzi-o-swicie.webp" alt="K2 fish farmer in a rowing boat on the pond at dawn – brand photography" loading="lazy" widths={[640, 960, 1280, 1600]} sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, min(1100px, 85vw)" quality={72} /></div><span class="cs-shot__tag" style="white-space:nowrap">Photo · Brand</span></figure>
  </div>
  <div class="cs-row cs-row--split">
    <figure class="cs-shot reveal" style="aspect-ratio:4/3"><div class="frame-media cs-shot__media"><AssetImage src="/assets/portfolio/k2/k2-baseny-hodowlane-pstraga.webp" alt="Rainbow trout rearing ponds at K2 fish farm" loading="lazy" widths={[640, 960, 1280, 1600]} sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, min(1100px, 85vw)" quality={72} /></div><span class="cs-shot__tag" style="white-space:nowrap">Photo · Farm</span></figure>
    <figure class="cs-shot reveal" data-d="1" style="aspect-ratio:4/3"><div class="frame-media cs-shot__media"><AssetImage src="/assets/portfolio/k2/k2-ikra-pstraga-teczowego-wylegarnia.webp" alt="Rainbow trout eggs in the K2 hatchery" loading="lazy" widths={[640, 960, 1280, 1600]} sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, min(1100px, 85vw)" quality={72} /></div><span class="cs-shot__tag" style="white-space:nowrap">Photo · Hatchery</span></figure>
  </div>
  <div class="cs-row cs-row--split">
    <figure class="cs-shot reveal" style="aspect-ratio:16/9"><div class="frame-media cs-shot__media"><AssetImage src="/assets/portfolio/k2/k2-hodowla-ryb-zdjecie-z-drona-dolina.webp" alt="K2 Fish Farm in a forested valley – drone photo" loading="lazy" widths={[640, 960, 1280, 1600]} sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, min(1100px, 85vw)" quality={72} /></div><span class="cs-shot__tag" style="white-space:nowrap">Drone · Valley</span></figure>
    <figure class="cs-shot reveal" data-d="1" style="aspect-ratio:16/9"><div class="frame-media cs-shot__media"><AssetImage src="/assets/portfolio/k2/k2-hodowla-ryb-staw-i-budynek-fotografia.webp" alt="K2 Fish Farm pond and building at golden hour" loading="lazy" widths={[640, 960, 1280, 1600]} sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, min(1100px, 85vw)" quality={72} /></div><span class="cs-shot__tag" style="white-space:nowrap">Drone · Pond</span></figure>
  </div>
  <div class="cs-row cs-row--split">
    <figure class="cs-shot reveal" style="aspect-ratio:4/3"><div class="frame-media cs-shot__media"><AssetImage src="/assets/portfolio/k2/k2-tecza-nad-hodowla-ryb-jesien.webp" alt="Rainbow over K2 Fish Farm in autumn – trout ponds in the valley" loading="lazy" widths={[640, 960, 1280, 1600]} sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, min(1100px, 85vw)" quality={72} /></div><span class="cs-shot__tag" style="white-space:nowrap">Photo · Autumn</span></figure>
    <figure class="cs-shot reveal" data-d="1" style="aspect-ratio:4/3"><div class="frame-media cs-shot__media"><AssetImage src="/assets/portfolio/k2/k2-filet-z-pstraga-teczowego-z-rozmarynem.webp" alt="Fresh K2 rainbow trout fillet with rosemary and peppercorns – product photography" loading="lazy" widths={[640, 960, 1280, 1600]} sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, min(1100px, 85vw)" quality={72} /></div><span class="cs-shot__tag" style="white-space:nowrap">Photo · Product</span></figure>
  </div>
  <div class="cs-row">
    <figure class="cs-shot reveal" style="aspect-ratio:21/9"><div class="frame-media cs-shot__media"><AssetImage src="/assets/portfolio/k2/k2-rzeka-o-swicie-okolice-hodowli-pstraga.webp" alt="River at dawn near K2 Fish Farm – clean water and autumn forest" loading="lazy" widths={[640, 960, 1280, 1600]} sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, min(1100px, 85vw)" quality={72} /></div><span class="cs-shot__tag" style="white-space:nowrap">Photo · Surroundings</span></figure>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ FILM ============ -->
<section class="cs-sec" data-screen-label="FILM">
  <div class="shell">
    <span class="cs-sec__no reveal">DRONE FILM</span>
    <h2 class="cs-sec__title reveal">Scale you can only<br>see <span class="accent">from above.</span></h2>
    <p class="cs-body reveal" data-d="1" style="max-width:54ch;margin-top:20px">Drone footage shows what no ground-level shot can: the size of the farm and how it sits in the landscape. The film works on the website, in presentations and at trade fairs.</p>
    <div class="cs-film reveal" data-d="1" style="margin-top:clamp(30px,4vh,48px)">
      <div class="cs-film__frame" data-cursor="play" data-yt="oeoytfRRqy4" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="Play K2 Fish Farm drone film">
        <AssetImage src="/assets/portfolio/k2/k2-hodowla-pstraga-zdjecie-z-drona-baseny.webp" alt="Still from the drone film – K2 Fish Farm ponds" loading="lazy" widths={[640, 960, 1280, 1600]} sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, min(1100px, 85vw)" quality={72} />
        <div class="cs-film__play"><span class="cs-film__btn" aria-hidden="true"></span></div>
        <div class="cs-film__meta"><span class="rec">● REC</span><span>K2 FISH FARM, DRONE</span><span>4K · 25FPS</span></div>
        <div class="cs-film__bar"><i></i></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ EFEKT ============ -->
<section class="cs-quote" aria-label="Outcome">
  <div class="shell cs-sec">
    <div class="cs-quote__inner reveal">
      <blockquote><span class="mark">„</span>A leading trout producer now has a brand that matches its position, from the logo and website to the presentation for buyer meetings.<span class="mark">”</span></blockquote>
      <div class="cs-quote__by">– <b>SEZMOO Team</b> · Branding, web, photo &amp; video</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ NEXT PROJECT ============ -->
<a class="cs-next bleed" href="/en/portfolio-en/" data-cursor="link" aria-label="Back to portfolio">
